@startuml US108-SSD
skinparam sequenceMessageAlign center
skinparam responseMessageBelowArrow true

actor "Backoffice Operator / ATCC" as Actor
participant ":System" as SYS

autonumber

Actor -> SYS : searchAirports(\n  city?  = "...",\n  country? = "...",\n  name?  = "..." )

SYS --> Actor : 200 OK\n( list of Airport summaries + HATEOAS links )

note over SYS
  [All criteria optional; absent criteria are treated as pass-all (returns all airports)]
  [Applies case-insensitive filter on AirportDetails attributes]
  [Returns matching airports; empty list if none match]
  [Each entry includes a link to full details — US107]
end note

@enduml
